## Quarto

Quarto is an open-source scientific and technical publishing system that allows you to create reproducible documents, presentations, websites, and books. It works with multiple programming languages including R, Python, Julia, and Observable JavaScript.

### Installing Quarto

Download and install Quarto from the official website: [https://quarto.org/docs/get-started/](https://quarto.org/docs/get-started/)

1. **Windows**: Download the Windows installer (.msi file) and run it
2. **macOS**: Download the macOS installer (.pkg file) and run it
3. **Linux**: Use the provided .deb or .tar.gz packages, or install via package manager

After installation, verify it's working by opening a terminal and running:
+## Quarto                                                                                                    
+                                                                                                             
+Quarto is an open-source scientific and technical publishing system that allows you to create reproducible   
documents, presentations, websites, and books. It works with multiple programming languages including R,      
Python, Julia, and Observable JavaScript.                                                                     
+                                                                                                             
+### Installing Quarto                                                                                        
+                                                                                                             
+Download and install Quarto from the official website:                                                       
[https://quarto.org/docs/get-started/](https://quarto.org/docs/get-started/)                                  
+                                                                                                             
+1. **Windows**: Download the Windows installer (.msi file) and run it                                        
+2. **macOS**: Download the macOS installer (.pkg file) and run it                                            
+3. **Linux**: Use the provided .deb or .tar.gz packages, or install via package manager                      
+                                                                                                             
+After installation, verify it's working by opening a terminal and running:                                   
                                                                                                              

quarto --version                                                                                              

                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
### Setting up Quarto with VS Code                                                                            
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
1. **Install the Quarto VS Code Extension**:                                                                  
                                                                                                              
   - Open VS Code                                                                                             
                                                                                                              
   - Go to the Extensions view (Ctrl+Shift+X or Cmd+Shift+X on Mac)                                           
                                                                                                              
   - Search for "Quarto"                                                                                      
                                                                                                              
   - Install the official Quarto extension by Quarto                                                          
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
2. **Create your first Quarto document**:                                                                     
                                                                                                              
   - Create a new file with a `.qmd` extension                                                                
                                                                                                              
   - Add the following basic content:                                                                         
                                                                                                              
   ```markdown                                                                                                
                                                                                                              
   ---                                                                                                        
                                                                                                              
   title: "My First Document"                                                                                 
                                                                                                              
   format: html                                                                                               
                                                                                                              
   ---                                                                                                        
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
   ## Introduction                                                                                            
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
   This is a Quarto document. You can include:                                                                
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
   - Markdown text                                                                                            
                                                                                                              
   - Code chunks                                                                                              
                                                                                                              
   - Mathematical equations: $E = mc^2$                                                                       
                                                                                                              

 3 Preview and render documents:                                                                              
    • Use the "Render" button in VS Code's editor toolbar                                                     
    • Or use Command Palette (Ctrl+Shift+P): "Quarto: Preview"                                                
    • Or from terminal: quarto preview filename.qmd                                                           
 4 Key features in VS Code:                                                                                   
    • Syntax highlighting for Quarto documents                                                                
    • Live preview with automatic updates                                                                     
    • Code completion for YAML options                                                                        
    • Integration with R, Python, and Julia kernels                                                           
    • Visual markdown editor mode                                                                             

Useful Quarto Commands                                                                                        

 • quarto render document.qmd - Render a document to its output format                                        
 • quarto preview document.qmd - Preview with live reload                                                     
 • quarto create project - Create a new Quarto project                                                        
 • quarto publish - Publish to GitHub Pages, Netlify, or Quarto Pub                                           

Resources                                                                                                     

 • Quarto Documentation                                                                                       
